<p><strong>A half-demake, half-fangame reconstruction of a certain part of Deltarune Chapter 3 for the actual NES!<br></strong></p>
<p>Made over the course of 3 months, this is an NES remake&nbsp;of certain events in Chapter 3 - but with a few twists of its own...</p>
<p><strong>Web Player Controls:</strong></p>
<table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Keyboard Key<br></strong></td><td><strong>NES Mapping</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Up Arrow</td><td>D-Pad Up</td></tr><tr><td>Down Arrow</td><td>D-Pad Down</td></tr><tr><td>Left Arrow</td><td>D-Pad Left</td></tr><tr><td>Right Arrow</td><td>D-Pad Right</td></tr><tr><td>Z Key</td><td>A (Attack/Interact)</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><strong>It is highly recommended to download the ROM and play on an offline&nbsp;emulator instead.</strong></p>
<p>Tested on the following emulators:</p>
<ul><li>Mesen (recommended!)</li><li>FCEUX</li><li>puNes</li><li>nestopia</li><li>ares</li></ul>
